            "reviewer_id": "User_p1_2",
            "review_title": "Review at Ruby Sky Bar & Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Stevieel69\n9 contributions\n0\nNice views of town - shame about the service\nJul 2024 • Family\nBooked a reservation for 7pm and ordered drinks, eventually managed to order food as language barrier was making it difficult but had to try several times. We were the only 5 customers in the place which has great views but over an hour later when the food arrived every single meal was stone cold. We were hungry but couldn’t even attempt to eat it, we paid for our drinks and left very disappointed. They offered to reheat the food up for us but by then it was too far gone.\nShame because even though the food that arrived wasn’t the rack of ribs and T-Bone steaks we ordered it looked ok.\nRead more\nWritten July 27, 2024\nLamor Boutique Hotel Quy Nhơn\nThank you for taking the time to share your experience with us. We sincerely apologize for the service issues you encountered during your visit. It’s disappointing to hear that despite having the restaurant to yourselves, the language barrier and delays affected your dining experience so negatively.\nWe understand how frustrating it must have been to receive cold food after waiting for over an hour, especially when you had ordered specific dishes. Please be assured that this is not the standard we aim to uphold. We appreciate your patience and regret that we didn’t meet your expectations.\nYour feedback about the food quality and service is invaluable and will be used to address these issues with our team. We are committed to making improvements and ensuring that such experiences do not occur in the future.\nWe hope you might consider giving us another chance if you are ever back in the area, as we would love the opportunity to provide you with a much better experience.\nThank you again for your feedback and for letting us know about the problems you faced.\nBest regards,\nRead more\nWritten August 31, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
