            "review_text": "Lamor Hotel I\n1 contribution\n0\nLet's Ruby fly away your night\nSep 2023 • Solo\nRuby Sky Bar provides me an awesome panoramic view of Quy Nhon by night. Awe-inspiring! While sipping signature cocktail and listening to music that’ll surely fresh our night away. Definitely a stress reliever, a good way to relax and see the sights from the top. Definitely worth the price for the vibe and ambience. You may opt to join one of the night tours of the city via scooter, and Ruby Sky bar is included as one of the first destinations. Just check the itinerary before you book. What a nice way to spend your night in Quy Nhon. We’ll definitely be back here someday.\nRead more\nWritten September 6, 2023\nRuby Sky Bar\nA hello from Ruby Sky Bar Team!\nOn behalf of our team, thank you for your review. \nYou made our day with your positive feedback! We are so happy to read that you loved our service. \nWe hope you'll continue to enjoy our services in the future and we are pleased to see you again soon,\nRegards,\nRead more\nWritten September 7, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
