            "review_text": "Sightseer56233872439\n2 contributions\n0\nA must-go bar in Quy nhon\nAug 2023 • Solo\nI did have an excellent night in one of the greatest bar in Quy Nhơn I guess. The view over to city by night is so lively, even the music and the sound system didn’t catch me up well but I still have a wonderful night with the cocktails here. The staff is such a friendly one that I didn’t feel any loneliness even I was there all by myself. A must-go destination for anyone whom is searching for a hidden place from bustling of the city and endure in music, friends and drinking.\nRead more\nWritten August 29, 2023\nRuby Sky Bar\nA hello from L'amor Boutique Hotel Quy Nhơn!\nOn behalf of our team, thank you for your review. You made our day with your positive feedback! We are so happy to read that you loved our service. \nWe hope you'll continue to enjoy staying our hotel in the near future.\nRegards,\nRead more\nWritten August 31, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
